{"articleNo":"194336","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=194336&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"매월 4일은 안전점검의 날","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.07.04","hit":"5599","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>「안전점검의 날」이란?</strong></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1994</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 성수대교 붕괴사고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, 1995</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 삼풍백화점 붕괴사고 등 대형 재난이 발생함에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">따라 우리 사회 곳곳에 상존하고 있는 안전 불감증을 청산하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 103%\">국민 스스로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 103%\">안전의 중요성을 인식하여 위험요인을 한달에 한번이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라도 안전을 점검하는 습관을 생활 속에서 실천하기 위해 시작되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">안전문화운동의 일환으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">’96. 4. 4.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">부터 행정 시책으로 실시해오다 그 중요성을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">강화하기 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2004</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">재난 및 안전관리 기본법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 따라 법적 행사로 시행하게 되었는데요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">매월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일을 안전점검의 날로 지정한 이유는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 102%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 102%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 102%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 102%\">는 불길한 숫자라고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 102%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 102%\">생각하는 국민들의 미신적인 마인드를 해소하기 위함이라고 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 102%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">안전 주제</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">풍수해</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">올해도 어김없이 태풍</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">쁘라삐룬</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이 한반도에 불어 닥치면서 국민들을 긴장케&nbsp;했습니다. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">태풍이 불면 강한 바람과 비 때문에 침수걱정을 해야 하는 사람들이 적지않기 때문인데요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">매년 장마나 태풍으로 인한 피해가 속출되고 있어 이로부터 자유로운 사람은 없을겁니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">장마와 태풍 같은 자연재해를 사전에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">100% </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">예방한다는 것은 불가능하지만 그래도 피해를 최소화하기 위한 사전준비 또는 점검을 당부하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">우리 주변에 비가 새는 곳은 없는지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하수도는 잘 뚫려 있는지 점검도 해보고,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">더불어 대응요령 등을 숙지해 보는 것은 어떨가 싶습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 244.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">그래서 이번달에는 태풍과 호우에 대한 대처요령 등에 관한 영상을 링크하였으니 많은 참고 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 